flowchart TB
  feeds[Curated public RSS / Atom feeds] --> collector[Sequential fetch with timeout and size cap]
  collector --> normalize[Normalize, attribute, and deduplicate]
  normalize --> cache[(Local JSON cache: metadata only)]
  demo[Space demo: fictional examples only; no RSS requests] --> analysis
  normalize --> analysis[Transparent analysis: keyword topics, VADER English sentiment, optional spaCy NER, extractive briefs, TF-IDF groups]
  analysis --> records[Analyzed story state; fictional records in the Space]
  records --> discovery[CPU filters, TF-IDF search, adjacent-window topic pulse]
  discovery --> dashboard[Gradio dashboard with source-linked cards]
  records --> cli[CLI JSON / CSV export]

  subgraph ZeroGPU_search[ZeroGPU semantic search — explicit button only]
    query[User query] --> gpu_search[@spaces.GPU callback, 30-second cap]
    model[Multilingual E5 model loaded on CUDA at startup] --> gpu_search
  end
  records --> gpu_search
  gpu_search --> dashboard
